## Error Codes by Category

### Authentication Errors (401, 403)

| Error Message | Status | Cause | Resolution |
|---------------|--------|-------|------------|
| `Not authenticated` | 401 | No valid session cookie | Login again |
| `Incorrect email or password` | 400* | Invalid credentials | Check credentials |
| `Unauthorized` | 401 | Missing or invalid session | Re-authenticate |
| `Access denied to this file` | 403 | Attempting to access another user's file | Only access your own resources |
| `Forbidden` | 403 | Insufficient permissions | Contact support for access |

**Note**: Login failures return 400 instead of 401 to prevent user enumeration attacks.

### Validation Errors (400)

| Error Message | Status | Cause | Resolution |
|---------------|--------|-------|------------|
| `Invalid input` | 400 | Missing or malformed request body | Check request payload |
| `Missing filename or contentType` | 400 | Storage upload missing parameters | Include required fields |
| `Missing fields` | 400 | Required fields not provided | Check API documentation |
| `Invalid email` | 400 | Email format invalid | Use valid email address |
| `Missing code` | 400 | Verification code not provided | Include code parameter |
| `Invalid or expired token` | 400 | Token expired or invalid | Request new token |
| `Prompt is required` | 400 | Missing prompt in AI request | Include prompt field |
| `Missing username` | 400 | Username query parameter missing | Include username parameter |

### Conflict Errors (409)

| Error Message | Status | Cause | Resolution |
|---------------|--------|-------|------------|
| `User already exists` | 409 | Email already registered | Use different email or login |

### Rate Limit Errors (429)

| Error Message | Status | Cause | Resolution |
|---------------|--------|-------|------------|
| `Too many requests, please try again later` | 429 | AI endpoint rate limit exceeded | Wait for `retryAfter` seconds |
| `Too many login attempts. Please try again in a minute.` | 429 | Login rate limit exceeded | Wait 60 seconds |
| `Too many signup attempts. Please try again in a minute.` | 429 | Signup rate limit exceeded | Wait 60 seconds |
| `Too many password reset requests. Please try again in a minute.` | 429 | Forgot password rate limit exceeded | Wait 60 seconds |
| `Too many password reset attempts. Please try again in a minute.` | 429 | Reset password rate limit exceeded | Wait 60 seconds |
| `API rate limit exceeded. Please slow down your requests.` | 429 | AI endpoint rate limit exceeded | Wait for rate limit window to reset |

### Server Errors (500, 503)

| Error Message | Status | Cause | Resolution |
|---------------|--------|-------|------------|
| `Unknown error occurred` | 500 | Unhandled server exception | Retry or contact support |
| `Server error during image edit` | 500 | Image editing pipeline failure | Check image format and try again |
| `Failed to generate upload URL` | 500 | GCS service error | Retry after brief delay |
| `Failed to generate read URL` | 500 | GCS service error | Retry after brief delay |
| `Failed to confirm upload` | 500 | Database or GCS error | Check file and retry |
| `Failed to delete file` | 500 | GCS deletion error | Retry or contact support |
| `OpenRouter API key not configured` | 401* | Missing API key in database | Configure API key in settings |
| `Replicate API Key not configured on server` | 500* | Missing server API key | Contact administrator |

