## Quick Reference

### Error Code Summary

| Code | Category | Retry? |
|------|----------|--------|
| 400 | Validation | No |
| 401 | Auth | No - Re-auth |
| 403 | Authorization | No |
| 404 | Resource | No |
| 409 | Conflict | No |
| 429 | Rate Limit | Yes - After delay |
| 500 | Server | Yes - With backoff |
| 503 | Provider | Yes - With backoff |

